  << /ActualText (UX Designer \024 StreetFeast \050independent mobile app project\051 \174 July 2025 \023 Present\nRan customer and vendor surveys \05069 responses\051 to validate the discovery problem on both sides of the marketplace\nSynthesized findings into the feature priorities and primary user flow for the first release\nDesigned the customer and vendor experiences in Figma alongside ongoing development\nCollaborated with 2 developers through implementation\054 refining designs from testing with food truck owners and customers)
