  << /ActualText (UX Researcher \046 Designer \024 Drink Studio \050academic team project\051 \174 March 2025 \023 May 2025\nSurveyed 8 participants on motivations and pain points in making drinks at home\nContributed ideation in FigJam\054 mapped the user flow\054 and produced sketches and screens for a step\055by\055step tutorial app\nTested the flow with 6 participants across 9 tasks \024 100\045 task success\054 SUS score of 91\05667\nAdded swipe navigation between steps after testing showed participants expected it)
