946 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UX Design Intern \024 Idea Lab\054 Western Kentucky University \174 August 2024 \023 November 2024\nContributed user research to the next iteration of SunSketcher\054 WKU\031s NASA\055supported citizen\055science eclipse app\nPartnered with a second researcher on localization for three target markets \024 Spain\054 Iceland\054 and Greenland \024 assessing language needs and whether the app should ship translated or in universal English\nSynthesized secondary sources in the absence of direct user access to identify where universal design would serve all three markets and where market\055specific treatment was needed\nPresented findings to stakeholders and developers\054 translating them into actionable design direction\nContributed to usability testing with 16 participants\073 the redesign reached 92\0567\045 task success and a SUS score of 86)
